@base = http://localhost:3000/api/bus-stops

### Listar todos
GET {{base}}

### Filtrar por búsqueda, tipo y estado
GET {{base}}?search=terminal&type=troncal&status=operando

### GeoJSON
GET {{base}}/geojson

### Obtener por id (registro seed)
GET {{base}}/BUS-001

### Crear
# @name create
POST {{base}}
Content-Type: application/json
{
  "name": "Parada CRUD",
  "type": "troncal",
  "status": "operando",
  "description": "Registro temporal para validar CRUD",
  "routesCount": 4,
  "location": { "type": "Point", "coordinates": [-101.68, 21.12] }
}
